# Mesh page mounts one canvas

The TaskMesh Mesh tab was stacking several copies of the Mesh panel. Only the bottom copy stayed wired to React, so only that one drew the project.

## Cause

`ProjectDetailPage` renders `MeshPanel` and `AskProjectPanel` as siblings, and both used `key={projectId}`. React keys must be unique among siblings. Each commit of the project page inserted a new Mesh shell and left the previous one in the document.

## Change

Give the two panels distinct keys: `mesh-${projectId}` and `ask-${projectId}`. Both still remount when the open project changes.
